### Production Considerations
- **Provider Selection**: Intelligent routing based on task type and provider performance
- **Tool Validation**: Schema validation for all tool arguments
- **Agent Coordination**: Sophisticated orchestration with state management
- **Memory Management**: Context preservation across AI sessions
- **Quality Assurance**: Automated validation of AI outputs

### Anti-Patterns to Avoid
- ❌ Using the same provider for all tasks (not leveraging strengths)
- ❌ Not validating tool arguments (security risk)
- ❌ No fallback mechanisms for provider failures
- ❌ Not preserving context across AI interactions
- ❌ Not validating AI output quality

